- [SettingsBindableAttribute](http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.componentmodel.settingsbindableattribute.aspx)- [INotifyPropertyChanged](http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/system.componentmodel.inotifypropertychanged.aspx)

